'''Plains Miwok''', also known as '''Valley Miwok''', was one of the [[Miwok language|Miwok]] languages spoken in central [[California]] by the [[Plains Miwok|Plains Miwok people]].  It was spoken in the deltas of the [[San Joaquin River|San Joaquin]] and [[Cosumnes River]]s. Plains Miwok was once one of the most populous [[Miwok]] languages. All of the population has shifted to [[English language|English]].

